IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ga-dates`
IMPORT `ga-core`
IMPORT `ga-enduring`

-- Guardianship Act 1987 (NSW) -- worked cases for every exported question in ga-core.l4 and ga-enduring.l4.
-- Every expected value was worked by hand from the deposited text; none was copied from the encoding's output. Each
-- assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Dates are illustrative.
-- BASELINE ENCODING. Not for public use as advice. See NOTES.md.

§ `cases -- definitions and enduring guardians`

`d` MEANS `the date`

`intellectual` MEANS `I am intellectually, physically, psychologically or sensorily disabled`
`aged` MEANS `I am of advanced age`
`mentally ill` MEANS `I am a mentally ill person within the meaning of the Mental Health Act 2007`
`otherwise` MEANS `I am otherwise disabled`
`no condition` MEANS `none of these`

`totally` MEANS `I am totally incapable of managing my person`
`partially` MEANS `I am partially incapable of managing my person`
`capable` MEANS `I am capable of managing my person`

`self` MEANS `I signed it myself, or made my mark`
`signer` MEANS `an eligible signer signed it for me, at my instruction and in my presence`
`unsigned` MEANS `it was signed in some other way, or not at all`

`lawyer` MEANS `an Australian legal practitioner`
`registrar` MEANS `a registrar of the Local Court`
`prescribed` MEANS `a person prescribed by the regulations`
`other witness` MEANS `someone else`

§§ `s 3(2) -- a person who has a disability`

#ASSERT `Do I count as a person who has a disability` `intellectual` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Do I count as a person who has a disability` `aged` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Do I count as a person who has a disability` `mentally ill` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Do I count as a person who has a disability` `otherwise` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- "and who, by virtue of that fact, is restricted ..." fails.
#ASSERT `Do I count as a person who has a disability` `mentally ill` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Do I count as a person who has a disability` `no condition` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `s 3(1) -- a person in need of a guardian`

-- Arguments: condition; restricted; how far I can manage my person; incapacity because of the disability.
#ASSERT `Am I a person in need of a guardian` `intellectual` TRUE `totally` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Am I a person in need of a guardian` `aged` TRUE `partially` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Am I a person in need of a guardian` `aged` TRUE `capable` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Am I a person in need of a guardian` `aged` TRUE `partially` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Am I a person in need of a guardian` `aged` FALSE `partially` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Am I a person in need of a guardian` `no condition` TRUE `totally` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `s 3D -- the care of me`

-- Arguments: had my care before I entered an institution; regularly provides or arranges; paid (not a carer's pension);
-- cares only as the institution.
#ASSERT `Does this person have the care of me` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Does this person have the care of me` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Does this person have the care of me` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does this person have the care of me` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Paid care, or no regular care: outside the open list of s 3D(1).
#ASSERT `Does this person have the care of me` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Does this person have the care of me` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 3E -- a close friend or relative`

#ASSERT `Is this person my close friend or relative` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is this person my close friend or relative` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is this person my close friend or relative` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is this person my close friend or relative` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `ss 6, 6I(2) -- can I appoint`

-- The 18th birthday itself, and the day before.
#ASSERT `Can I appoint an enduring guardian` (`d` 15 6 2008) (`d` 15 6 2026) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I appoint an enduring guardian` (`d` 15 6 2008) (`d` 14 6 2026) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Born on 29 February: 18 on 28 February in a common year (fork F1).
#ASSERT `Can I appoint an enduring guardian` (`d` 29 2 2008) (`d` 28 2 2026) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I appoint an enduring guardian` (`d` 29 2 2008) (`d` 27 2 2026) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Under a guardianship order: "of no effect".
#ASSERT `Can I appoint an enduring guardian` (`d` 1 1 1950) (`d` 1 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `s 6B -- who may be my enduring guardian`

#ASSERT `Is this person eligible to be my enduring guardian` (`d` 1 1 2000) (`d` 1 1 2026) FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is this person eligible to be my enduring guardian` (`d` 1 1 2000) (`d` 1 1 2026) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is this person eligible to be my enduring guardian` (`d` 1 1 2000) (`d` 1 1 2026) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 18 on the day of appointment, and one day short.
#ASSERT `Is this person eligible to be my enduring guardian` (`d` 1 1 2008) (`d` 1 1 2026) FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is this person eligible to be my enduring guardian` (`d` 2 1 2008) (`d` 1 1 2026) FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

#ASSERT `Does the appointment lapse because my enduring guardian began providing paid services` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does the appointment lapse because my enduring guardian began providing paid services` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `ss 5, 6C -- does my document work`

-- Arguments: 18 or over; order in force; prescribed form; how signed; signer eligible; acceptance endorsed; kind of
-- witness; a witness is an appointee; witnesses certified; instruction certified; Tribunal confirmed.
#ASSERT `Does my appointment document operate` TRUE FALSE TRUE `self` TRUE TRUE `lawyer` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Does my appointment document operate` TRUE FALSE TRUE `self` TRUE TRUE `registrar` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Does my appointment document operate` TRUE FALSE TRUE `self` TRUE TRUE `prescribed` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Does my appointment document operate` TRUE FALSE TRUE `self` TRUE TRUE `other witness` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does my appointment document operate` TRUE FALSE TRUE `self` TRUE TRUE `lawyer` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does my appointment document operate` TRUE FALSE TRUE `self` TRUE FALSE `lawyer` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does my appointment document operate` TRUE FALSE FALSE `self` TRUE TRUE `lawyer` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does my appointment document operate` TRUE FALSE TRUE `self` TRUE TRUE `lawyer` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Signed for me by an eligible signer: the signer's eligibility and the witness's certificate of my instruction.
#ASSERT `Does my appointment document operate` TRUE FALSE TRUE `signer` TRUE TRUE `lawyer` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Does my appointment document operate` TRUE FALSE TRUE `signer` TRUE TRUE `lawyer` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does my appointment document operate` TRUE FALSE TRUE `signer` FALSE TRUE `lawyer` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does my appointment document operate` TRUE FALSE TRUE `unsigned` TRUE TRUE `lawyer` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A guardianship order in force; under 18; and the Tribunal's confirmation, which cures every defect (s 6K(4), (5)).
#ASSERT `Does my appointment document operate` TRUE TRUE TRUE `self` TRUE TRUE `lawyer` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does my appointment document operate` FALSE FALSE TRUE `self` TRUE TRUE `lawyer` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Does my appointment document operate` TRUE FALSE FALSE `unsigned` FALSE FALSE `other witness` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Does my appointment document operate` TRUE TRUE TRUE `self` TRUE TRUE `lawyer` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE

§§ `s 6A and following -- does the appointment have effect now`

-- Arguments: in need now; revoked by me; married someone else since; s 6HC saves it; Tribunal revoked; guardianship
-- order in force; Tribunal suspended.
#ASSERT `Does my enduring guardian's appointment have effect now` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `it has effect now`
#ASSERT `Does my enduring guardian's appointment have effect now` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `it does not have effect now, because I am not a person in need of a guardian`
#ASSERT `Does my enduring guardian's appointment have effect now` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `it has been revoked`
#ASSERT `Does my enduring guardian's appointment have effect now` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `it has been revoked`
#ASSERT `Does my enduring guardian's appointment have effect now` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `it has effect now`
#ASSERT `Does my enduring guardian's appointment have effect now` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `it has been revoked`
#ASSERT `Does my enduring guardian's appointment have effect now` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `it is suspended while a guardianship order is in force about me`
#ASSERT `Does my enduring guardian's appointment have effect now` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `it is suspended by the Tribunal pending its review`
#ASSERT `Does my enduring guardian's appointment have effect now` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `it is suspended while a guardianship order is in force about me`

§§ `s 6E -- what my enduring guardian can decide`

#ASSERT `Can my enduring guardian make this decision` `where I live` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can my enduring guardian make this decision` `the health care I receive` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can my enduring guardian make this decision` `the other personal services I receive` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can my enduring guardian make this decision` `consent under Part 5 to medical or dental treatment on me` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can my enduring guardian make this decision` `another function relating to my person that my instrument specifies` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can my enduring guardian make this decision` `managing my money or property` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Can my enduring guardian make this decision` `something else my instrument does not specify` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Can my enduring guardian make this decision` `where I live` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can my enduring guardian make this decision` `the health care I receive` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can my enduring guardian make this decision` `managing my money or property` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `s 6H -- revoking`

-- Arguments: capacity; prescribed form; how signed; signer eligible; kind of witness; witness is an appointee; witness
-- certified; instruction certified; written notice given to the appointee.
#ASSERT `Does my revocation operate` TRUE TRUE `self` TRUE `lawyer` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Does my revocation operate` TRUE TRUE `self` TRUE `lawyer` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does my revocation operate` FALSE TRUE `self` TRUE `lawyer` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does my revocation operate` TRUE FALSE `self` TRUE `lawyer` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does my revocation operate` TRUE TRUE `self` TRUE `other witness` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does my revocation operate` TRUE TRUE `self` TRUE `lawyer` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does my revocation operate` TRUE TRUE `signer` TRUE `registrar` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Does my revocation operate` TRUE TRUE `signer` TRUE `registrar` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does my revocation operate` TRUE TRUE `self` TRUE `lawyer` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `s 6HB -- resigning`

-- Arguments: I am in need of a guardian; compliant written notice to me; Tribunal approval.
#ASSERT `Has my enduring guardian validly resigned` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Has my enduring guardian validly resigned` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Has my enduring guardian validly resigned` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Has my enduring guardian validly resigned` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Has my enduring guardian validly resigned` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `s 6DA -- my substitute`

#ASSERT `Can my substitute enduring guardian act for me now` FALSE `has died` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can my substitute enduring guardian act for me now` TRUE `has died` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can my substitute enduring guardian act for me now` TRUE `has resigned` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can my substitute enduring guardian act for me now` TRUE `is incapacitated` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can my substitute enduring guardian act for me now` TRUE `is alive, has not resigned and is not incapacitated` EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `ss 6J, 6K, 6MA -- the Tribunal`

#ASSERT `Must the Tribunal review my enduring guardian's appointment` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Must the Tribunal review my enduring guardian's appointment` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

#ASSERT `Can the Tribunal revoke my enduring guardian's appointment` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can the Tribunal revoke my enduring guardian's appointment` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can the Tribunal revoke my enduring guardian's appointment` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

#ASSERT `Can the Tribunal appoint this person as my substitute enduring guardian` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can the Tribunal appoint this person as my substitute enduring guardian` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can the Tribunal appoint this person as my substitute enduring guardian` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can the Tribunal appoint this person as my substitute enduring guardian` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `s 6O -- interstate`

#ASSERT `Does my interstate appointment work in NSW` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Does my interstate appointment work in NSW` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Does my interstate appointment work in NSW` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
